tran 50n 3m
* Loop-closure / startup-release sanity, same criteria/sense as
* sim/closed-loop-vref-pvt, evaluated at t=3ms.
meas tran v_fb_v find v(fb) at=3m
meas tran v_sns1_v find v(sns1) at=3m
meas tran v_sns2_v find v(sns2) at=3m
meas tran v_det_v find v(det) at=3m
meas tran i_mkfb_v find i(Vmkfb) at=3m
* The claim under test: vref at two separated time points, so
* run_pvt_sweep.sh can confirm it has stopped moving before reporting it.
meas tran v_vref_2ms find v(vref) at=2m
meas tran v_vref_3ms find v(vref) at=3m
* VBE(Q3) (decision-support parity with sim/closed-loop-vref-pvt's own
* issue #133 probe): Q3 is diode-connected with its emitter tied to vss,
* so v(cb3) IS VBE(Q3) directly.
meas tran v_vbeq3_2ms find v(cb3) at=2m
meas tran v_vbeq3_3ms find v(cb3) at=3m
.endc
.end
